  "title": "Oven-Baked Barbecue Rib Tips",
  "description": "Rib tips are cooked in the oven low and slow until tender, then smothered in barbecue sauce and broiled until charred for a tasty, meaty appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Bibi"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-08-08T02:14:22-04:00",
